- bond
-  lain_types [order=38]
-  lain_peek [order=39]
-  lain_poke [order=40]
+  pact  - pact
+  eden
  +  first
    ' The first step of the boot process
    ' Initialise lain at / pact at /pact, and foil compiler at /foil
    ' This is so that all further updates can flow thru lain itself
    \  lain=vine pact=kook
    ^  axal[note]
    =  root (myth/sing bond/content lain)
       pact (myth/sing bond/content pact)
    (axal/new[note] (./some (./make root))).put('/pact (./make pact))
  +  second
    ' Actually drive
    3
